# Riding on the Clouds (jeuno 131): the level operand alone. A level 60 Warrior at level cap 65 (a GM), MAX_LEVEL 99:
# the available check wants level 61: no section (no other limit break answers at cap 65): MAAT_DIALOG. Level 61 is the
# main flow (88).
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrigger
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=WAR lvl=60
levelcap 65
login
trigger Maat                            # level 60: no section; MAAT_DIALOG
